      // Dynamically change text based on ACCEPTED or REJECTED
      const fallbackMsg = mode === "ACCEPTED"
        ? "Partial approval process started in background. You will be notified upon completion."
        : "Partial rejection process started in background. You will be notified upon completion.";

      const displayMessage = response?.message || fallbackMsg;
      showSnackBar(displayMessage, "info");

```
Now, when you click **Reject**, the snackbar will correctly say *"Rejection process started..."*!
